{"ticker":"MIDHANI","symbol":"MIDHANI","instrumentId":3155216,"name":"Mishra Dhatu Nig","industry":"NSE-Steel-Producers","about":"Mishra Dhatu Nigam (MIDHANI) is a premier manufacturer of specialized metals and alloys, catering to strategic sectors such as aerospace, defense, nuclear, and energy. The company produces high-performance materials like superalloys, titanium alloys, special steels, and magnetic alloys, which are crucial for advanced engineering applications. MIDHANI’s products are used in manufacturing aircraft engines, missile systems, nuclear reactors, and other critical components, ensuring superior strength, heat resistance, and reliability. With state-of-the-art facilities and a focus on research and development, MIDHANI plays a vital role in supporting India's technological and defense capabilities by delivering world-class metallurgical solutions for strategic needs.","website":"www.midhani-india.in","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:41:49.506Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":393.85,"changePct":2.1130412237490366,"week52High":477,"week52Low":270.45},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹7,378 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹1,364 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"48,708,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"95"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"17,587,356"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.53%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"4.82"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"2.4"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"1.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.08"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.69"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-9%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"49.17"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"20–121"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"8.6%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"11.58"},{"label":"Volume","value":"422,703"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"1,857,836"},{"label":"Master score","value":"60"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"64"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"